{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1539466-can-i-make-a-summoner","id":1539466,"title":"Can I Make a Summoner?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Deviant: The Renegades"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-29T06:27:24-07:00","id":1539466,"title":"Can I Make a Summoner?","content":"For my next chronicle I was thinking to play a Deviant Summoner.<br /> <br /> I'm working on two options:<br /> <br /> 1) My characrer can summon random entities every time and make them fight or perform tasks for him.<br /> <br /> 2) My character is bound to a specific entity that he can control.<br /> <br /> How I can put this concept on sheet?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-29T06:36:30-07:00","id":1539467,"title":"","content":"Start by buying <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/m/product/486079\" target=\"_blank\">Shallow Graves</a>; it's the Player's Guide for <b>Deviant</b>, produced through Storyteller's Vault because Paradox has shut down the normal production channels. Then go to Chapter Two, look up \u201cForms\u201d, and select the Summoner Form.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-29T06:40:51-07:00","id":1539468,"title":"","content":"So I cannot shape a summoner with the corebook only?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-29T07:28:37-07:00","id":1539469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ipergigio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1539466-can-i-make-a-summoner?p=1539468#post1539468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I cannot shape a summoner with the corebook only?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Summoner Form is not published in the corebook, meaning if you want to have mechanics for this you'd need to homebrew. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1535691-shallow-graves-a-player-s-guide-to-deviant-the-renegades?p=1536558#post1536558\">The material previewed in the thread for Shallow Graves</a> is there, but you could also model summoned creatures with the Retainer and/or Manticore Companion Merits and a Scar that isn't entangled with any other Variations.<br /> <br /> Shallow Graves also provides the Beast Mastery Variation and the Shadow-Binder Merit that expands on the corebook's Otherworldly Connection Variation, but apart from that your options are, again, largely down to homebrew material unless you really want to strain the limits of credibility on reading what Superhuman Manipulation 3+ can get you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 07-29-2024, 10:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-01T13:39:21-07:00","id":1539661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ipergigio</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1539466-can-i-make-a-summoner#post1539466\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For my next chronicle I was thinking to play a Deviant Summoner.<br /> <br /> I'm working on two options:<br /> <br /> 1) My characrer can summon random entities every time and make them fight or perform tasks for him.<br /> <br /> 2) My character is bound to a specific entity that he can control.<br /> <br /> How I can put this concept on sheet?</div> </div> </div> </div>It depends upon what you expect out of a &quot;summoner.&quot; <br /> <br /> For example, you could create a lash, and flavor that as &quot;my character summons an otherworldly entity that strikes on my character's behalf then vanishes&quot; and that could work. But if you're wanting to &quot;summon&quot; a separate being and have it have it's own independent actions and dicepools then mostly no, you can't do that in the core book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-05T03:05:36-07:00","id":1539835,"title":"","content":"Thank you guys. But sadly the chronicle got aborted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2457-ipergigio","name":"Ipergigio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2457_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}